  "prefLabel": "He-C 5004.12 Third Party Liability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-C 5004.12 Third Party Liability. All third party obligations shall be exhausted before Title XIX shall be billed, in accordance with 42 CFR 433.139.\n\nSource. #13651, eff 5-26-23",
